A comment span in a quote closes at an unmarked closer

```
> %%%
> secret
%%%
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
```

```
> %%%
> secret
%%%
> more
.
<blockquote><p>more</p></blockquote>
```

```
> %%%
> secret
  %%%
after
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>after</p>
```

```
> > %%%
> > secret
%%%
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>

  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > %%%
> > secret
%%%
> more
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>

  </blockquote>
  <p>more</p>
</blockquote>
```

```
> %%%
> secret
.
<blockquote><p>secret</p></blockquote>
```
